  <categories>
    <category>Network</category>
    <category>FileTransfer</category>
    <category>Utility</category>
  </categories>
  <description>
    <p>
      Nextcloud Native brings files, photos, media, collaboration, and installed
      Nextcloud apps together in one coherent native desktop client.
    </p>
    <p>
      It uses native controls and verified server capabilities instead of embedding
      the web interface. Account data stays between this app and the Nextcloud
      servers you choose.
    </p>
    <ul>
      <li>Browse files, photos, media, activity, and collaboration apps.</li>
      <li>Use native controls without embedding the web interface.</li>
      <li>Adapt installed Nextcloud apps to reusable native workflows.</li>
    </ul>
  </description>
